# Kubernetes HA Cluster Installation Guide

**3 control-plane (master) nodes + worker nodes, Ubuntu, kubeadm, containerd, Calico, HAProxy + keepalived**

This guide builds a highly available Kubernetes cluster where any one master can fail without taking down the cluster. Every command block states which node(s) it runs on. Every step explains why it is needed.

