## 2. Values to change before you start

Search and replace these throughout the document.

| Placeholder in this guide | Meaning | Your value |
|---|---|---|
| `corp.example.com` | Your organisation's DNS domain | |
| `192.168.1.0/24` | Node network | |
| `192.168.1.1` | Default gateway | |
| `192.168.1.100` | Virtual IP for the API (must be free, same subnet as masters) | |
| `192.168.1.11 / .12 / .13` | master1 / master2 / master3 | |
| `192.168.1.21 / .22` | worker1 / worker2 | |
| `10.10.10.53, 10.10.10.54` | Your organisation's DNS servers | |
| `ens18` | Network interface name on the nodes (`ip a` to find it) | |
| `10.244.0.0/16` | Pod network. Must NOT overlap with any real network you use | |
| `v1.36` | Kubernetes minor version. Check https://kubernetes.io/releases/ | |
| `v3.32.2` | Calico version. Check https://github.com/projectcalico/calico/releases | |

**Hardware minimums:** masters 2 CPU / 4 GB RAM / 40 GB disk; workers 2 CPU / 2 GB RAM. All nodes: Ubuntu 22.04 or 24.04, static IP, internet access (for packages and images), unique hostname, unique MAC address.

