## 3. Which step runs on which node

| Step | master1 | master2 | master3 | worker1 | worker2 | Workstation |
|---|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
| DNS records (request from DNS team) | | | | | | request |
| Step 1 — Prepare node | yes | yes | yes | yes | yes | |
| Step 2 — HAProxy + keepalived | yes | yes | yes | | | |
| Step 3 — `kubeadm init` | **yes only** | | | | | |
| Step 4 — Calico | **yes only** | | | | | |
| Step 5 — Join as control plane | | yes | yes | | | |
| Step 6 — Join as worker | | | | yes | yes | |
| Step 7 — Verify | any one master | | | | | |
| Step 8 — kubectl access | | | | | | yes |

Order matters: finish Step 1 on **all** nodes before Step 2. Finish Step 4 before Step 5. Join masters one at a time.

